      "class_lore": "<blockquote><p><strong>Loremasters</strong> are known for their insatiable curiosity and appetite for discovery. They firmly believe that knowledge equates to power, and would often trade all gold in the world for a chance at solving a good mystery.</p><p> Unfortunately, a majority of Loremasters tend to be aloof and easily distracted, rarely concerning themselves with “pragmatic” matters... to the point of sometimes failing to realize the darker implications of their discoveries.</p></blockquote>",
